1
00:00:00,738 --> 00:00:05,508
(Bernadette:)It's like I was excited
for a present and got socks.

2
00:00:06,511 --> 00:00:08,141
(Stuart:)I don't understand how
that turns into

3
00:00:08,146 --> 00:00:09,816
(Stuart:)the worst fight of your life.

4
00:00:09,814 --> 00:00:12,114
(Sheldon:)I don't understand
what's wrong with socks.

5
00:00:12,116 --> 00:00:14,186
(Penny:)To be fair,
we may have been on edge

6
00:00:14,185 --> 00:00:15,915
(Penny:)because of the Christmas tree.

7
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:18,050
(Penny:)What happened
with the tree?

8
00:00:23,661 --> 00:00:24,861
(Penny:)You do make a cute elf.

9
00:00:24,862 --> 00:00:26,192
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah?

10
00:00:26,197 --> 00:00:30,337
(Leonard:)And you thought Spock ears
were only good for Comic-Con.

11
00:00:30,335 --> 00:00:31,935
(Penny:)Hey, hey, I just found a farm

12
00:00:31,936 --> 00:00:33,936
(Penny:)where they let you chop down
your own tree.

13
00:00:33,938 --> 00:00:39,578
(Leonard:)Oh cool, I'll be like
a pointy-eared Paul Bunyan.

14
00:00:46,751 --> 00:00:49,321
(Leonard:)Stupid idea.

15
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:51,620
(Penny:)No, what's stupid is a physicist

16
00:00:51,622 --> 00:00:53,622
(Penny:)who doesn't understand
when you swing an axe,

17
00:00:53,624 --> 00:00:56,694
(Penny:)you don't let go.

18
00:00:56,694 --> 00:00:59,834
(Leonard:)For the tenth time,
my mittens were slippery!

